<div class="kb-row-layout-wrap kb-row-layout-id620_da88cc-eb alignfull has-theme-palette8-background-color kt-row-has-bg wp-block-kadence-rowlayout"><div class="kt-row-layout-top-sep kt-row-sep-type-sltl"><svg viewBox="0 0 1000 100" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path d="M1000,0l-1000,100l1000,0l0,-100Z" /></svg></div><div class="kt-row-layout-bottom-sep kt-row-sep-type-sltl"><svg viewBox="0 0 1000 100" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path d="M1000,0l-1000,100l1000,0l0,-100Z" /></svg></div><div class="kt-row-column-wrap kt-has-1-columns kt-row-layout-equal kt-tab-layout-inherit kt-mobile-layout-row kt-row-valign-top kb-theme-content-width">

<div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column620_5c8316-2a"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col">
<p><script type="8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-text/javascript">
  function changesoundy(ID) {
    var sound_id = document.getElementById("quran_player_by_sora");
    sound_id.innerHTML = '<div style="margin-top:15px;"><audio controls autoplay><source src="'+ID+'" type="audio/mpeg">Your browser does not support the audio element.</audio><br /><a href="'+ID+'">Download this file</a></div>';
  }
</script><h2 class="sora_title">An-Nas ( Mankind ) - الناس</h2><div id="quran_player_by_sora"></div><div class="quran_gateway_by_sora"><div class="aya_ar_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/114001.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">قُلْ أَعُوذُ بِرَبِّ النَّاسِ <span class="sora_name_by_sora">الناس [1]</span></div><div class="aya_en_by_sora">Say, "I seek refuge in the Lord of mankind, <span class="sora_name_by_sora">An-Nas ( Mankind ) [1]</span></div></div><div class="quran_gateway_by_sora"><div class="aya_ar_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/114002.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">مَلِكِ النَّاسِ <span class="sora_name_by_sora">الناس [2]</span></div><div class="aya_en_by_sora">The Sovereign of mankind. <span class="sora_name_by_sora">An-Nas ( Mankind ) [2]</span></div></div><div class="quran_gateway_by_sora"><div class="aya_ar_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/114003.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">إِلَٰهِ النَّاسِ <span class="sora_name_by_sora">الناس [3]</span></div><div class="aya_en_by_sora">The God of mankind, <span class="sora_name_by_sora">An-Nas ( Mankind ) [3]</span></div></div><div class="quran_gateway_by_sora"><div class="aya_ar_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/114004.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">مِن شَرِّ الْوَسْوَاسِ الْخَنَّاسِ <span class="sora_name_by_sora">الناس [4]</span></div><div class="aya_en_by_sora">From the evil of the retreating whisperer - <span class="sora_name_by_sora">An-Nas ( Mankind ) [4]</span></div></div><div class="quran_gateway_by_sora"><div class="aya_ar_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/114005.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">الَّذِي يُوَسْوِسُ فِي صُدُورِ النَّاسِ <span class="sora_name_by_sora">الناس [5]</span></div><div class="aya_en_by_sora">Who whispers [evil] into the breasts of mankind - <span class="sora_name_by_sora">An-Nas ( Mankind ) [5]</span></div></div><div class="quran_gateway_by_sora"><div class="aya_ar_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/114006.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">مِنَ الْجِنَّةِ وَالنَّاسِ <span class="sora_name_by_sora">الناس [6]</span></div><div class="aya_en_by_sora">From among the jinn and mankind." <span class="sora_name_by_sora">An-Nas ( Mankind ) [6]</span></div></div></p>

</div></div>

</div></div>

