<li class="kt-blocks-testimonial-carousel-item kb-slide-item splide__slide"><div class="kt-testimonial-item-wrap kt-testimonial-item-620_1f6695-ba wp-block-kadence-testimonial"><div class="kt-testimonial-text-wrap"><div class="kt-svg-testimonial-global-icon-wrap"><div class='kt-svg-testimonial-global-icon kt-svg-testimonial-global-icon-icon-fas_quote-left'><svg viewBox="0 0 512 512"  fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"  aria-hidden="true"><path d="M464 256h-80v-64c0-35.3 28.7-64 64-64h8c13.3 0 24-10.7 24-24V56c0-13.3-10.7-24-24-24h-8c-88.4 0-160 71.6-160 160v240c0 26.5 21.5 48 48 48h128c26.5 0 48-21.5 48-48V304c0-26.5-21.5-48-48-48zm-288 0H96v-64c0-35.3 28.7-64 64-64h8c13.3 0 24-10.7 24-24V56c0-13.3-10.7-24-24-24h-8C71.6 32 0 103.6 0 192v240c0 26.5 21.5 48 48 48h128c26.5 0 48-21.5 48-48V304c0-26.5-21.5-48-48-48z"/></svg></div></div><div class="kt-testimonial-content-wrap"><blockquote class="kt-testimonial-content">The site is a site for serving  the Holy Qur’an, the last heavenly book and the only correct book on the face of the earth.</blockquote></div></div><div class="kt-testimonial-meta-wrap"><div class="kt-testimonial-media-wrap"><div class="kt-testimonial-media-inner-wrap"><div class="kadence-testimonial-image-intrisic"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="150" height="150" src="https://quranbook.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/images-3-150x150.jpg" class="kt-testimonial-image wp-image-633 size-thumbnail" alt="" /></div></div></div><div class="kt-testimonial-meta-name-wrap"><div class="kt-testimonial-name-wrap"><div class="kt-testimonial-name">Servant of Islam</div></div><div class="kt-testimonial-occupation-wrap"><div class="kt-testimonial-occupation">Thank God</div></div></div></div></div></li>
<li class="kt-blocks-testimonial-carousel-item kb-slide-item splide__slide"><div class="kt-testimonial-item-wrap kt-testimonial-item-620_401685-c9 wp-block-kadence-testimonial"><div class="kt-testimonial-text-wrap"><div class="kt-svg-testimonial-global-icon-wrap"><div class='kt-svg-testimonial-global-icon kt-svg-testimonial-global-icon-icon-fas_quote-left'><svg viewBox="0 0 512 512"  fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"  aria-hidden="true"><path d="M464 256h-80v-64c0-35.3 28.7-64 64-64h8c13.3 0 24-10.7 24-24V56c0-13.3-10.7-24-24-24h-8c-88.4 0-160 71.6-160 160v240c0 26.5 21.5 48 48 48h128c26.5 0 48-21.5 48-48V304c0-26.5-21.5-48-48-48zm-288 0H96v-64c0-35.3 28.7-64 64-64h8c13.3 0 24-10.7 24-24V56c0-13.3-10.7-24-24-24h-8C71.6 32 0 103.6 0 192v240c0 26.5 21.5 48 48 48h128c26.5 0 48-21.5 48-48V304c0-26.5-21.5-48-48-48z"/></svg></div></div><div class="kt-testimonial-content-wrap"><blockquote class="kt-testimonial-content">Thanks to quranbook.org, I have found a deeper connection with the teachings of the Holy Quran.</blockquote></div></div><div class="kt-testimonial-meta-wrap"><div class="kt-testimonial-media-wrap"><div class="kt-testimonial-media-inner-wrap"><div class="kadence-testimonial-image-intrisic"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="150" height="150" src="https://quranbook.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/Free-Smiling-Boy-Holding-a-Quran-Stock-Photo-150x150.jpg" class="kt-testimonial-image wp-image-53 size-thumbnail" alt="" /></div></div></div><div class="kt-testimonial-meta-name-wrap"><div class="kt-testimonial-name-wrap"><div class="kt-testimonial-name">Abdullah.</div></div><div class="kt-testimonial-occupation-wrap"><div class="kt-testimonial-occupation"></div></div></div></div></div></li>
</ul></div></div></div></div>
