<div class="kb-row-layout-wrap kb-row-layout-id620_f55c64-30 alignfull has-theme-palette2-background-color kt-row-has-bg wp-block-kadence-rowlayout"><div class="kt-row-column-wrap kt-has-1-columns kt-row-layout-equal kt-tab-layout-inherit kt-mobile-layout-row kt-row-valign-top kb-theme-content-width">

<div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column620_602bf4-24 inner-column-1"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col">
<p><script type="8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-text/javascript">
  function changesoundy(ID) {
    var sound_id = document.getElementById("quran_player_by_sora");
    sound_id.innerHTML = '<div style="margin-top:15px;"><audio controls autoplay><source src="'+ID+'" type="audio/mpeg">Your browser does not support the audio element.</audio><br /><a href="'+ID+'">Download this file</a></div>';
  }
</script><h2 class="sora_title">Al-Mulk ( Dominion ) - الملك</h2><div id="quran_player_by_sora"></div><div class="quran_gateway_by_sora"><div class="aya_ar_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/067001.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">تَبَارَكَ الَّذِي بِيَدِهِ الْمُلْكُ وَهُوَ عَلَىٰ كُلِّ شَيْءٍ قَدِيرٌ <span class="sora_name_by_sora">الملك [1]</span></div><div class="aya_en_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/English_Translated_by_Sahih_International_Recited_by_Ibrahim_Walk/067001.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">Blessed is He in whose hand is dominion, and He is over all things competent - <span class="sora_name_by_sora">Al-Mulk ( Dominion ) [1]</span></div></div><div class="quran_gateway_by_sora"><div class="aya_ar_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/067002.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">الَّذِي خَلَقَ الْمَوْتَ وَالْحَيَاةَ لِيَبْلُوَكُمْ أَيُّكُمْ أَحْسَنُ عَمَلًا ۚ وَهُوَ الْعَزِيزُ الْغَفُورُ <span class="sora_name_by_sora">الملك [2]</span></div><div class="aya_en_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/English_Translated_by_Sahih_International_Recited_by_Ibrahim_Walk/067002.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">[He] who created death and life to test you [as to] which of you is best in deed - and He is the Exalted in Might, the Forgiving - <span class="sora_name_by_sora">Al-Mulk ( Dominion ) [2]</span></div></div><div class="quran_gateway_by_sora"><div class="aya_ar_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/067003.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">الَّذِي خَلَقَ سَبْعَ سَمَاوَاتٍ طِبَاقًا ۖ مَّا تَرَىٰ فِي خَلْقِ الرَّحْمَٰنِ مِن تَفَاوُتٍ ۖ فَارْجِعِ الْبَصَرَ هَلْ تَرَىٰ مِن فُطُورٍ <span class="sora_name_by_sora">الملك [3]</span></div><div class="aya_en_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/English_Translated_by_Sahih_International_Recited_by_Ibrahim_Walk/067003.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">[And] who created seven heavens in layers. You do not see in the creation of the Most Merciful any inconsistency. So return [your] vision [to the sky]; do you see any breaks? <span class="sora_name_by_sora">Al-Mulk ( Dominion ) [3]</span></div></div><div class="quran_gateway_by_sora"><div class="aya_ar_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/067004.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">ثُمَّ ارْجِعِ الْبَصَرَ كَرَّتَيْنِ يَنقَلِبْ إِلَيْكَ الْبَصَرُ خَاسِئًا وَهُوَ حَسِيرٌ <span class="sora_name_by_sora">الملك [4]</span></div><div class="aya_en_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/English_Translated_by_Sahih_International_Recited_by_Ibrahim_Walk/067004.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">Then return [your] vision twice again. [Your] vision will return to you humbled while it is fatigued. <span class="sora_name_by_sora">Al-Mulk ( Dominion ) [4]</span></div></div><div class="quran_gateway_by_sora"><div class="aya_ar_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/067005.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">وَلَقَدْ زَيَّنَّا السَّمَاءَ الدُّنْيَا بِمَصَابِيحَ وَجَعَلْنَاهَا رُجُومًا لِّلشَّيَاطِينِ ۖ وَأَعْتَدْنَا لَهُمْ عَذَابَ السَّعِيرِ <span class="sora_name_by_sora">الملك [5]</span></div><div class="aya_en_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/English_Translated_by_Sahih_International_Recited_by_Ibrahim_Walk/067005.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">And We have certainly beautified the nearest heaven with stars and have made [from] them what is thrown at the devils and have prepared for them the punishment of the Blaze. <span class="sora_name_by_sora">Al-Mulk ( Dominion ) [5]</span></div></div><div class="quran_gateway_by_sora"><div class="aya_ar_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/067006.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">وَلِلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا بِرَبِّهِمْ عَذَابُ جَهَنَّمَ ۖ وَبِئْسَ الْمَصِيرُ <span class="sora_name_by_sora">الملك [6]</span></div><div class="aya_en_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/English_Translated_by_Sahih_International_Recited_by_Ibrahim_Walk/067006.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">And for those who disbelieved in their Lord is the punishment of Hell, and wretched is the destination. <span class="sora_name_by_sora">Al-Mulk ( Dominion ) [6]</span></div></div><div class="quran_gateway_by_sora"><div class="aya_ar_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/067007.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">إِذَا أُلْقُوا فِيهَا سَمِعُوا لَهَا شَهِيقًا وَهِيَ تَفُورُ <span class="sora_name_by_sora">الملك [7]</span></div><div class="aya_en_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/English_Translated_by_Sahih_International_Recited_by_Ibrahim_Walk/067007.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">When they are thrown into it, they hear from it a [dreadful] inhaling while it boils up. <span class="sora_name_by_sora">Al-Mulk ( Dominion ) [7]</span></div></div><div class="quran_gateway_by_sora"><div class="aya_ar_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/067008.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">تَكَادُ تَمَيَّزُ مِنَ الْغَيْظِ ۖ كُلَّمَا أُلْقِيَ فِيهَا فَوْجٌ سَأَلَهُمْ خَزَنَتُهَا أَلَمْ يَأْتِكُمْ نَذِيرٌ <span class="sora_name_by_sora">الملك [8]</span></div><div class="aya_en_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/English_Translated_by_Sahih_International_Recited_by_Ibrahim_Walk/067008.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">It almost bursts with rage. Every time a company is thrown into it, its keepers ask them, "Did there not come to you a warner?" <span class="sora_name_by_sora">Al-Mulk ( Dominion ) [8]</span></div></div><div class="quran_gateway_by_sora"><div class="aya_ar_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/067009.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">قَالُوا بَلَىٰ قَدْ جَاءَنَا نَذِيرٌ فَكَذَّبْنَا وَقُلْنَا مَا نَزَّلَ اللَّهُ مِن شَيْءٍ إِنْ أَنتُمْ إِلَّا فِي ضَلَالٍ كَبِيرٍ <span class="sora_name_by_sora">الملك [9]</span></div><div class="aya_en_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/English_Translated_by_Sahih_International_Recited_by_Ibrahim_Walk/067009.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">They will say," Yes, a warner had come to us, but we denied and said, 'Allah has not sent down anything. You are not but in great error.'" <span class="sora_name_by_sora">Al-Mulk ( Dominion ) [9]</span></div></div><div class="quran_gateway_by_sora"><div class="aya_ar_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/067010.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">وَقَالُوا لَوْ كُنَّا نَسْمَعُ أَوْ نَعْقِلُ مَا كُنَّا فِي أَصْحَابِ السَّعِيرِ <span class="sora_name_by_sora">الملك [10]</span></div><div class="aya_en_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/English_Translated_by_Sahih_International_Recited_by_Ibrahim_Walk/067010.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">And they will say, "If only we had been listening or reasoning, we would not be among the companions of the Blaze." <span class="sora_name_by_sora">Al-Mulk ( Dominion ) [10]</span></div></div><div class="quran_gateway_by_sora"><div class="aya_ar_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/067011.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">فَاعْتَرَفُوا بِذَنبِهِمْ فَسُحْقًا لِّأَصْحَابِ السَّعِيرِ <span class="sora_name_by_sora">الملك [11]</span></div><div class="aya_en_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/English_Translated_by_Sahih_International_Recited_by_Ibrahim_Walk/067011.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">And they will admit their sin, so [it is] alienation for the companions of the Blaze. <span class="sora_name_by_sora">Al-Mulk ( Dominion ) [11]</span></div></div><div class="quran_gateway_by_sora"><div class="aya_ar_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/067012.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">إِنَّ الَّذِينَ يَخْشَوْنَ رَبَّهُم بِالْغَيْبِ لَهُم مَّغْفِرَةٌ وَأَجْرٌ كَبِيرٌ <span class="sora_name_by_sora">الملك [12]</span></div><div class="aya_en_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/English_Translated_by_Sahih_International_Recited_by_Ibrahim_Walk/067012.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">Indeed, those who fear their Lord unseen will have forgiveness and great reward. <span class="sora_name_by_sora">Al-Mulk ( Dominion ) [12]</span></div></div><div class="quran_gateway_by_sora"><div class="aya_ar_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/067013.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">وَأَسِرُّوا قَوْلَكُمْ أَوِ اجْهَرُوا بِهِ ۖ إِنَّهُ عَلِيمٌ بِذَاتِ الصُّدُورِ <span class="sora_name_by_sora">الملك [13]</span></div><div class="aya_en_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/English_Translated_by_Sahih_International_Recited_by_Ibrahim_Walk/067013.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">And conceal your speech or publicize it; indeed, He is Knowing of that within the breasts. <span class="sora_name_by_sora">Al-Mulk ( Dominion ) [13]</span></div></div><div class="quran_gateway_by_sora"><div class="aya_ar_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/067014.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">أَلَا يَعْلَمُ مَنْ خَلَقَ وَهُوَ اللَّطِيفُ الْخَبِيرُ <span class="sora_name_by_sora">الملك [14]</span></div><div class="aya_en_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/English_Translated_by_Sahih_International_Recited_by_Ibrahim_Walk/067014.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">Does He who created not know, while He is the Subtle, the Acquainted? <span class="sora_name_by_sora">Al-Mulk ( Dominion ) [14]</span></div></div><div class="quran_gateway_by_sora"><div class="aya_ar_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/067015.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">هُوَ الَّذِي جَعَلَ لَكُمُ الْأَرْضَ ذَلُولًا فَامْشُوا فِي مَنَاكِبِهَا وَكُلُوا مِن رِّزْقِهِ ۖ وَإِلَيْهِ النُّشُورُ <span class="sora_name_by_sora">الملك [15]</span></div><div class="aya_en_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/English_Translated_by_Sahih_International_Recited_by_Ibrahim_Walk/067015.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">It is He who made the earth tame for you - so walk among its slopes and eat of His provision - and to Him is the resurrection. <span class="sora_name_by_sora">Al-Mulk ( Dominion ) [15]</span></div></div><div class="quran_gateway_by_sora"><div class="aya_ar_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/067016.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">أَأَمِنتُم مَّن فِي السَّمَاءِ أَن يَخْسِفَ بِكُمُ الْأَرْضَ فَإِذَا هِيَ تَمُورُ <span class="sora_name_by_sora">الملك [16]</span></div><div class="aya_en_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/English_Translated_by_Sahih_International_Recited_by_Ibrahim_Walk/067016.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">Do you feel secure that He who [holds authority] in the heaven would not cause the earth to swallow you and suddenly it would sway? <span class="sora_name_by_sora">Al-Mulk ( Dominion ) [16]</span></div></div><div class="quran_gateway_by_sora"><div class="aya_ar_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/067017.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">أَمْ أَمِنتُم مَّن فِي السَّمَاءِ أَن يُرْسِلَ عَلَيْكُمْ حَاصِبًا ۖ فَسَتَعْلَمُونَ كَيْفَ نَذِيرِ <span class="sora_name_by_sora">الملك [17]</span></div><div class="aya_en_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/English_Translated_by_Sahih_International_Recited_by_Ibrahim_Walk/067017.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">Or do you feel secure that He who [holds authority] in the heaven would not send against you a storm of stones? Then you would know how [severe] was My warning. <span class="sora_name_by_sora">Al-Mulk ( Dominion ) [17]</span></div></div><div class="quran_gateway_by_sora"><div class="aya_ar_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/067018.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">وَلَقَدْ كَذَّبَ الَّذِينَ مِن قَبْلِهِمْ فَكَيْفَ كَانَ نَكِيرِ <span class="sora_name_by_sora">الملك [18]</span></div><div class="aya_en_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/English_Translated_by_Sahih_International_Recited_by_Ibrahim_Walk/067018.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">And already had those before them denied, and how [terrible] was My reproach. <span class="sora_name_by_sora">Al-Mulk ( Dominion ) [18]</span></div></div><div class="quran_gateway_by_sora"><div class="aya_ar_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/067019.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">أَوَلَمْ يَرَوْا إِلَى الطَّيْرِ فَوْقَهُمْ صَافَّاتٍ وَيَقْبِضْنَ ۚ مَا يُمْسِكُهُنَّ إِلَّا الرَّحْمَٰنُ ۚ إِنَّهُ بِكُلِّ شَيْءٍ بَصِيرٌ <span class="sora_name_by_sora">الملك [19]</span></div><div class="aya_en_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/English_Translated_by_Sahih_International_Recited_by_Ibrahim_Walk/067019.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">Do they not see the birds above them with wings outspread and [sometimes] folded in? None holds them [aloft] except the Most Merciful. Indeed He is, of all things, Seeing. <span class="sora_name_by_sora">Al-Mulk ( Dominion ) [19]</span></div></div><div class="quran_gateway_by_sora"><div class="aya_ar_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/067020.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">أَمَّنْ هَٰذَا الَّذِي هُوَ جُندٌ لَّكُمْ يَنصُرُكُم مِّن دُونِ الرَّحْمَٰنِ ۚ إِنِ الْكَافِرُونَ إِلَّا فِي غُرُورٍ <span class="sora_name_by_sora">الملك [20]</span></div><div class="aya_en_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/English_Translated_by_Sahih_International_Recited_by_Ibrahim_Walk/067020.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">Or who is it that could be an army for you to aid you other than the Most Merciful? The disbelievers are not but in delusion. <span class="sora_name_by_sora">Al-Mulk ( Dominion ) [20]</span></div></div><div class="quran_gateway_by_sora"><div class="aya_ar_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/067021.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">أَمَّنْ هَٰذَا الَّذِي يَرْزُقُكُمْ إِنْ أَمْسَكَ رِزْقَهُ ۚ بَل لَّجُّوا فِي عُتُوٍّ وَنُفُورٍ <span class="sora_name_by_sora">الملك [21]</span></div><div class="aya_en_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/English_Translated_by_Sahih_International_Recited_by_Ibrahim_Walk/067021.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">Or who is it that could provide for you if He withheld His provision? But they have persisted in insolence and aversion. <span class="sora_name_by_sora">Al-Mulk ( Dominion ) [21]</span></div></div><div class="quran_gateway_by_sora"><div class="aya_ar_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/067022.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">أَفَمَن يَمْشِي مُكِبًّا عَلَىٰ وَجْهِهِ أَهْدَىٰ أَمَّن يَمْشِي سَوِيًّا عَلَىٰ صِرَاطٍ مُّسْتَقِيمٍ <span class="sora_name_by_sora">الملك [22]</span></div><div class="aya_en_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/English_Translated_by_Sahih_International_Recited_by_Ibrahim_Walk/067022.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">Then is one who walks fallen on his face better guided or one who walks erect on a straight path? <span class="sora_name_by_sora">Al-Mulk ( Dominion ) [22]</span></div></div><div class="quran_gateway_by_sora"><div class="aya_ar_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/067023.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">قُلْ هُوَ الَّذِي أَنشَأَكُمْ وَجَعَلَ لَكُمُ السَّمْعَ وَالْأَبْصَارَ وَالْأَفْئِدَةَ ۖ قَلِيلًا مَّا تَشْكُرُونَ <span class="sora_name_by_sora">الملك [23]</span></div><div class="aya_en_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/English_Translated_by_Sahih_International_Recited_by_Ibrahim_Walk/067023.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">Say, "It is He who has produced you and made for you hearing and vision and hearts; little are you grateful." <span class="sora_name_by_sora">Al-Mulk ( Dominion ) [23]</span></div></div><div class="quran_gateway_by_sora"><div class="aya_ar_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/067024.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">قُلْ هُوَ الَّذِي ذَرَأَكُمْ فِي الْأَرْضِ وَإِلَيْهِ تُحْشَرُونَ <span class="sora_name_by_sora">الملك [24]</span></div><div class="aya_en_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/English_Translated_by_Sahih_International_Recited_by_Ibrahim_Walk/067024.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">Say, "It is He who has multiplied you throughout the earth, and to Him you will be gathered." <span class="sora_name_by_sora">Al-Mulk ( Dominion ) [24]</span></div></div><div class="quran_gateway_by_sora"><div class="aya_ar_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/067025.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">وَيَقُولُونَ مَتَىٰ هَٰذَا الْوَعْدُ إِن كُنتُمْ صَادِقِينَ <span class="sora_name_by_sora">الملك [25]</span></div><div class="aya_en_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/English_Translated_by_Sahih_International_Recited_by_Ibrahim_Walk/067025.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">And they say, "When is this promise, if you should be truthful?" <span class="sora_name_by_sora">Al-Mulk ( Dominion ) [25]</span></div></div><div class="quran_gateway_by_sora"><div class="aya_ar_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/067026.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">قُلْ إِنَّمَا الْعِلْمُ عِندَ اللَّهِ وَإِنَّمَا أَنَا نَذِيرٌ مُّبِينٌ <span class="sora_name_by_sora">الملك [26]</span></div><div class="aya_en_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/English_Translated_by_Sahih_International_Recited_by_Ibrahim_Walk/067026.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">Say, "The knowledge is only with Allah, and I am only a clear warner." <span class="sora_name_by_sora">Al-Mulk ( Dominion ) [26]</span></div></div><div class="quran_gateway_by_sora"><div class="aya_ar_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/067027.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">فَلَمَّا رَأَوْهُ زُلْفَةً سِيئَتْ وُجُوهُ الَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا وَقِيلَ هَٰذَا الَّذِي كُنتُم بِهِ تَدَّعُونَ <span class="sora_name_by_sora">الملك [27]</span></div><div class="aya_en_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/English_Translated_by_Sahih_International_Recited_by_Ibrahim_Walk/067027.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">But when they see it approaching, the faces of those who disbelieve will be distressed, and it will be said, "This is that for which you used to call." <span class="sora_name_by_sora">Al-Mulk ( Dominion ) [27]</span></div></div><div class="quran_gateway_by_sora"><div class="aya_ar_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/067028.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">قُلْ أَرَأَيْتُمْ إِنْ أَهْلَكَنِيَ اللَّهُ وَمَن مَّعِيَ أَوْ رَحِمَنَا فَمَن يُجِيرُ الْكَافِرِينَ مِنْ عَذَابٍ أَلِيمٍ <span class="sora_name_by_sora">الملك [28]</span></div><div class="aya_en_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/English_Translated_by_Sahih_International_Recited_by_Ibrahim_Walk/067028.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">Say, [O Muhammad], "Have you considered: whether Allah should cause my death and those with me or have mercy upon us, who can protect the disbelievers from a painful punishment?" <span class="sora_name_by_sora">Al-Mulk ( Dominion ) [28]</span></div></div><div class="quran_gateway_by_sora"><div class="aya_ar_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/067029.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">قُلْ هُوَ الرَّحْمَٰنُ آمَنَّا بِهِ وَعَلَيْهِ تَوَكَّلْنَا ۖ فَسَتَعْلَمُونَ مَنْ هُوَ فِي ضَلَالٍ مُّبِينٍ <span class="sora_name_by_sora">الملك [29]</span></div><div class="aya_en_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/English_Translated_by_Sahih_International_Recited_by_Ibrahim_Walk/067029.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">Say, "He is the Most Merciful; we have believed in Him, and upon Him we have relied. And you will [come to] know who it is that is in clear error." <span class="sora_name_by_sora">Al-Mulk ( Dominion ) [29]</span></div></div><div class="quran_gateway_by_sora"><div class="aya_ar_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/067030.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">قُلْ أَرَأَيْتُمْ إِنْ أَصْبَحَ مَاؤُكُمْ غَوْرًا فَمَن يَأْتِيكُم بِمَاءٍ مَّعِينٍ <span class="sora_name_by_sora">الملك [30]</span></div><div class="aya_en_by_sora" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/English_Translated_by_Sahih_International_Recited_by_Ibrahim_Walk/067030.mp3');" data-cf-modified-8accf48d4572848aadb0015c-="">Say, "Have you considered: if your water was to become sunken [into the earth], then who could bring you flowing water?" <span class="sora_name_by_sora">Al-Mulk ( Dominion ) [30]</span></div></div></p>

</div></div>

</div></div></div><!-- .entry-content -->
	</div>
